1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,229
TEN YEARS from now,

2
00:00:01,229 --> 00:00:03,301
your life could look COMPLETELY DIFFERENT.

3
00:00:03,421 --> 00:00:04,855
And one of the BIGGEST reasons

4
00:00:04,855 --> 00:00:06,464
might be what you decide to do

5
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:07,709
with your money TODAY.

6
00:00:08,009 --> 00:00:09,651
You don't need to be RICH to begin.

7
00:00:09,771 --> 00:00:12,366
Imagine saving just $100 each month,

8
00:00:12,366 --> 00:00:14,773
while LEARNING how to start a SMALL BUSINESS

9
00:00:14,773 --> 00:00:16,555
with SKILLS you already have.

10
00:00:16,855 --> 00:00:19,928
If you invested $100 EVERY MONTH

11
00:00:19,928 --> 00:00:20,471
for 10 YEARS,

12
00:00:20,471 --> 00:00:22,167
you'd put in $12,000.

13
00:00:22,287 --> 00:00:24,876
At an AVERAGE 7% yearly return,

14
00:00:24,876 --> 00:00:27,535
it COULD grow to about $17,000!

15
00:00:27,835 --> 00:00:29,691
Or imagine starting a SMALL BUSINESS.

16
00:00:29,811 --> 00:00:32,414
Your FIRST customer might only pay $50.

17
00:00:32,534 --> 00:00:34,032
But by IMPROVING your skills

18
00:00:34,032 --> 00:00:35,320
and finding MORE CUSTOMERS,

19
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,867
you could slowly build something MUCH BIGGER.

20
00:00:38,167 --> 00:00:39,703
Of course, some businesses FAIL,

21
00:00:39,703 --> 00:00:41,559
and investments can LOSE money.

22
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:44,363
But 10 years of LEARNING, SAVING, and IMPROVING

23
00:00:44,363 --> 00:00:45,939
can give you OPPORTUNITIES

24
00:00:45,939 --> 00:00:47,610
you might never have had otherwise.

25
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:49,682
You don't have to become a MILLIONAIRE

26
00:00:49,682 --> 00:00:50,705
to CHANGE YOUR LIFE.

27
00:00:50,825 --> 00:00:53,332
Having SAVINGS, useful SKILLS, and more CHOICES

28
00:00:53,332 --> 00:00:54,729
is already SUCCESS.

29
00:00:54,849 --> 00:00:56,427
Your future won't BUILD ITSELF.

30
00:00:56,547 --> 00:00:58,318
What SMALL STEP could you take TODAY?

